  "content": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mwstitle section\">\n\n    <h1 property=\"name\" class=\"wb-inv\" id=\"wb-cont\" dir=\"ltr\">\nVeterans and military</h1>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"provisional profile\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"intro col-md-12 col-sm-12 mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<h1 id=\"wb-cont\" class=\"provisional gc-thickline\">Veterans and military</h1>\n<p class=\"\">Services for current and former members of the Canadian Armed Forces (CAF), the RCMP, and their families.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<section class=\"provisional gc-most-requested well well-sm brdr-0 mrgn-tp-0\"><div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"pddng-r-0 col-md-2\">\n<h2 class=\"mrgn-tp-md\">Most requested</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-10\">\n\n<ul class=\"wb-eqht mrgn-tp-md mrgn-bttm-md colcount-md-2 wb-init wb-eqht-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-4\"><li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 24px;\"><a href=\"https://forces.ca/en/careers/\">Find a job in the military</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 24px;\"><a href=\"/en/department-national-defence/services/benefits-military/transition/service-card.html\">Veteran’s Service Card</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 24px;\"><a href=\"https://www.veterans.gc.ca/eng/e_services?utm_source=header&amp;utm_medium=button&amp;utm_campaign=MVA\">My VAC Account</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 24px;\"><a href=\"/en/department-national-defence/services/benefits-military/pay-pension-benefits/pay.html\">Military pay</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 24px;\"><a href=\"/en/department-national-defence/services/benefits-military/transition.html\">Military career transition</a></li>\n<li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 24px;\"><a href=\"https://www.veterans.gc.ca/en/health-programs-and-services/mental-health-and-wellness\">Mental health and wellness for Veterans</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<section class=\"gc-srvinfo col-md-12\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Services and information</h2><div class=\"wb-eqht row wb-init\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.veterans.gc.ca/en\">Veteran services and benefits</a></h3>\n<p>Financial support, healthcare, disability and other benefits for Veterans of the Canadian Armed Forces or the <abbr title=\"Royal Canadian Mounted Police\">RCMP</abbr>, and their families.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/government/publicservice/benefitsmilitary.html\">Military services and benefits</a></h3>\n<p>Pay, pension, transition, housing, education, training and health services and benefits for CAF members and their families.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 176px;\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/government/publicservice/benefitsrcmp.html\">RCMP services and benefits</a></h3>\n<p>Pay, pension, benefits, programs and services for <abbr title=\"Royal Canadian Mounted Police\">RCMP</abbr> members and their families.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 203px;\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/veterans-military/jobs-for-veterans-and-military-members.html\">Education and jobs for Veterans and military members</a></h3>\n<p>Job opportunities and career support for former and current members of the Canadian Armed Forces.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 203px;\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/veterans-military/health-and-wellness-for-veterans-and-military-members.html\">Health and wellness for Veterans and military</a></h3>\n<p>Physical and mental health support and services for Veterans, military members, and their families, including treatment for PTSD.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 203px;\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/defence/caf.html\">Canadian Armed Forces</a></h3>\n<p>Military history, ranks, orders, equipment, operations, medals.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<section class=\"provisional gc-contributors col-md-12\"><h2>From:</h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.veterans.gc.ca/en\">Veterans Affairs Canada </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/department-national-defence.html\">National Defence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.rcmp-grc.gc.ca/\">Royal Canadian Mounted Police (RCMP)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/army.html\">Canadian Army</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/navy.html\">Royal Canadian Navy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/air-force.html\">Royal Canadian Air Force</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/en/special-operations-forces-command.html\">Canadian Special Operations Forces Command</a></li>\n</ul></section></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t</div>"
